msgctxt "MeshMCPage|"
msgid "<html><head/>\n"
"<body>\n"
"<p>MeshMC sends anonymous usage statistics on every start of the application.</p><p>The following data is collected:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>MeshMC version.</li>\n"
"<li>Operating system name, version and architecture.</li>\n"
"<li>CPU architecture (kernel architecture on linux).</li>\n"
